flowchart TD
  Start([Task]) --> Plan[Planner]
  Plan --> Approval{Human approval?}
  Approval -->|pending| Wait[Return pending_approval]
  Approval -->|approved / off| Research[Research + corpus_search]
  Research --> Validate[Tool validation]
  Validate --> Execute[Executor tools]
  Execute --> Critic[Critic]
  Critic --> Reflect{Reflect}
  Reflect -->|improve| Research
  Reflect -->|pass| Synth[LLM synthesize]
  Synth --> End([Answer + traces])
  Execute -.->|tool fail| Retry[Retry / recovery]
  Retry --> Critic
